:''For the enemy encountered in the [[Bikkuriman Collaboration Event]], see [[Heracrist (Enemy)]].''
'''Heracrist''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 8.5 Update|Version 8.5]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Bikkuriman Collaboration Event]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 13.6 Update|Version 13.6]] swaps target to [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] and trades [[Immune to Warp|Warp Immunity]] for [[Immune to Curse|Curse Immunity]].

